"enums inheriting from :class:`~enum.ReprEnum` it will be the member's value;"
" for all other enums it will be the enum and member name (e.g. "
"``Color.RED``)."
msgstr ""
"Zmeneneno :meth:`Enum.__format__() <enum.Enum.__format__>` (vychozi pro "
":func:`format`, :meth:`str.format` a :term:`f-string`\\s) vzdy produkovat "
