#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:964
msgid "sqlite3"
msgstr "sqlite3"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:966
msgid ""
"You can now disable the authorizer by passing :const:`None` to "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`. (Contributed by Erlend E. "
"Aasland in :issue:`44491`.)"
msgstr ""
"Můžete nyní zakazat autorizator predaním :const:`None` do "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`. (Prispeno Erlend E. Aasland v "
":issue:`44491`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:970
msgid ""
"Collation name :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` can now contain "
"any Unicode character.  Collation names with invalid characters now raise "
":exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` instead of :exc:`sqlite3.ProgrammingError`. "
"(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`44688`.)"
msgstr ""
"Název kolace :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_collation` může nyní "
"obsahovat libovolný znak Unicode. Názvy kolací s neplatnými znaky nyní "
"vyvolají :exc:`UnicodeEncodeError` místo :exc:`sqlite3.ProgrammingError`. "
"(Prispeno Erlend E. Aasland v :issue:`44688`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:975
msgid ""
":mod:`sqlite3` exceptions now include the SQLite extended error code as "
":attr:`~sqlite3.Error.sqlite_errorcode` and the SQLite error name as "
":attr:`~sqlite3.Error.sqlite_errorname`. (Contributed by Aviv Palivoda, "
"Daniel Shahaf, and Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`16379` and :issue:`24139`.)"
msgstr ""
"Výjimky :mod:`sqlite3` nyní obsahují rozsířený kód chyby SQLite jako "
":attr:`~sqlite3.Error.sqlite_errorcode` a název chyby SQLite jako "
":attr:`~sqlite3.Error.sqlite_errorname`. (Prispeno Aviv Palivoda, Daniel "
"Shahaf a Erlend E. Aasland v :issue:`16379` a :issue:`24139`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:981
msgid ""
"Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.setlimit` and "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.getlimit` to :class:`sqlite3.Connection` for "
"setting and getting SQLite limits by connection basis. (Contributed by "
"Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`45243`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.setlimit` a "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.getlimit` do :class:`sqlite3.Connection` pro "
"nastaveni a ziskani SQLite limitu na zaklade spojeni. (Prispeno Erlend E. "
"Aasland v :issue:`45243`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:986
msgid ""
":mod:`sqlite3` now sets :attr:`sqlite3.threadsafety` based on the default "
"threading mode the underlying SQLite library has been compiled with. "
"(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`45613`.)"
msgstr ""
":mod:`sqlite3` nyní nastavi :attr:`sqlite3.threadsafety` na zaklade vychozi "
"rezim vlakna, ve kterem byla podkladna SQLite knihovna zkompilovna. "
"(Prispeno Erlend E. Aasland v :issue:`45613`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:990
msgid ""
":mod:`sqlite3` C callbacks now use unraisable exceptions if callback "
"tracebacks are enabled. Users can now register an :func:`unraisable hook "
"handler <sys.unraisablehook>` to improve their debug experience. "
"(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`45828`.)"
msgstr ""
":mod:`sqlite3` C zpetna volani nyní pouzivaji nezdvihnutelne vyjimky, pokud "
"je callback traceback povolen. Uzivatelkš mohou nyní registrovat "
":func:`unraisable hook handler <sys.unraisablehook>` ke zlepseni jejich "
"ladici zkusenosti. (Prispeno Erlend E. Aasland v :issue:`45828`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:996
msgid ""
"Fetch across rollback no longer raises :exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError`. "
"Instead we leave it to the SQLite library to handle these cases. "
"(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in :issue:`44092`.)"
msgstr ""
"Nacitani pres rollback uz nevyvola :exc:`~sqlite3.InterfaceError`. Miste "
"toho to necham SQLite knihovne aby to zpracovala. (Prispeno Erlend E. "
"Aasland v :issue:`44092`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:1000
msgid ""
"Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.serialize` and "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.deserialize` to :class:`sqlite3.Connection` for "
"serializing and deserializing databases. (Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland "
