msgstr ""
"Pridej :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.serialize` a "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.deserialize` do :class:`sqlite3.Connection` pro "
"serializaci a deserializaci databazi. (Prispeno Erlend E. Aasland v "
":issue:`41930`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:1005
msgid ""
"Add :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_window_function` to "
