#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:2474
msgid ""
"The Python frame object is now created lazily. A side effect is that the "
":attr:`~frame.f_back` member must not be accessed directly, since its value "
"is now also computed lazily. The :c:func:`PyFrame_GetBack` function must be "
"called instead."
msgstr ""
"Objekt Python ramce je nyn vytvoren lenive. Vedlejsi efekt je, ze clen "
":attr:`~frame.f_back` nesmusi byt pristupovany primo, jelikoz je jeho "
"hodnota nyn vypoctena take lenive. Funkce :c:func:`PyFrame_GetBack` musi byt"
" volana miste toho."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.11.rst:2480
msgid ""
"Debuggers that accessed the :attr:`~frame.f_locals` directly *must* call "
":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` instead. They no longer need to call "
":c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocalsWithError` or :c:func:`!PyFrame_LocalsToFast`,"
" in fact they should not call those functions. The necessary updating of the"
" frame is now managed by the virtual machine."
msgstr ""
"Ladici programy, ktere pristupovaly :attr:`~frame.f_locals` primo, *musi* "
"miste toho volat :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`. Jiz nepotrebuj volat "
":c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocalsWithError` nebo "
":c:func:`!PyFrame_LocalsToFast`, ve skutecnosti by nebyly volat tyto funkce."
" Potrebna aktualizace ramce je nyn spravovana virtualni masinou."

